      (property "Evidence" "Molex 5559 and 44478 series data accessed 2026-08-06; PS-44476-001 rev D dated 2003-06-12; ATS-638190900 rev H dated 2015-08-28. Six-contact 16 AWG HCS project-side screen is 21 A / 3 = 7 A per contact versus the published 11 A HCS guideline. The adapter-side contact construction and real current division are not published, so received-harness thermal, crimp and current-division tests remain mandatory." (at 0.00 0.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (hide yes)))
